      "data": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Flow Cytometry CD 19</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Instrument:&nbsp;</strong>BD FACS LY RIC AUTOMATED 10 colour Flow cytometer using BD FACS SUITE.<br><strong>Technique:&nbsp;</strong>Flow Cytometry Single Platform Technology, beads based count.<br>Specimens are sequentially gated as follows:<br>CD45 Leucocyte common antigen &gt;&gt; CD19-cells&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Methodology: LNW (Lyse no wash).</p>\n<p><strong>Results:</strong></p>\n<table class=\"Table cke_show_border\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 99%;\" border=\"1\" align=\"left\" data-cke-table-faked-selection-table=\"\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Test Name</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Result</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Unit</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p><strong>Ref. Reading</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD19<sup>&nbsp;</sup>Absolute Count</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>24.86</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>cells/ul</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>110.00-570.00</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>CD19<sup>&nbsp;</sup>Percentage</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>1.14</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>%</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"cke_table-faked-selection\" style=\"padding: 1px;\">\n<p>6.00-23.00</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Note: </strong>The assay result is sensitive to preanalytical variables (sample storage, transport, time to processing). Please review with clinical details (if required). Clinical correlation is advised.</p>\n<p><strong>Interpretation Guidelines:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>CD19&nbsp;is a transmembrane protein that is specifically expressed in normal and neoplastic B cells.</li>\n<li>It is expressed on most B-cell malignancies.</li>\n<li>It is expressed in the B-cell lineage at an early stage, even before the expression of CD20.</li>\n<li>It internalizes efficiently in lymphoma tumor models.</li>\n<li>It is possibly involved in the development of B-cell cancers, several studies reported that CD19 can upregulate the expression and phosphorylation of c-Myc.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Note:&nbsp;</strong>All investigations have their limitations which are imposed by the limits of sensitivity and specificity of a particular assay procedures as well as the quality of the specimen received by MDRC. Isolated laboratory investigations never confirm the final diagnosis of the disease. They only help in arriving at a diagnosis in conjunction with clinical presentation and other related investigations.&nbsp;</p>",
        "field": "textEditor"
      },
